'==============================================================
MemberAiSupportController ..> AiSupportService : delegates
MemberAiSupportController ..> AiSupportDtos: consumes
MemberFormCorrectionController ..> FormCorrectionService : delegates
MemberFormCorrectionController ..> FormCorrectionDtos: consumes
MemberFormRuleController ..> MemberFormRuleService : delegates
MemberFormRuleController ..> FormCorrectionDtos: consumes
MemberProgressionController ..> ProgressionRuleService : delegates
MemberProgressionController ..> ExerciseResultDtos: consumes
ProgressionRuleController ..> ProgressionRuleService : delegates
ProgressionRuleController ..> ProgressionRuleDtos: consumes
PhysiologyEvidenceController ..> ExercisePhysiologyService : delegates
PhysiologyEvidenceController ..> PhysiologyDtos: consumes
MemberExerciseController ..> MemberExerciseService : delegates
MemberExerciseController ..> MemberExerciseDtos: consumes
AiSupportService ..> AiSupportDtos: produces
FormCorrectionService ..> FormCorrectionDtos: produces
MemberFormRuleService ..> FormCorrectionDtos: produces
ProgressionRuleService ..> ProgressionRuleDtos: produces
ExercisePhysiologyService ..> PhysiologyDtos: produces
PhysiologyAlertService ..> PhysiologyDtos: produces
MemberFavoriteService ..> FavoriteDtos: produces
MemberExerciseService ..> MemberExerciseDtos: produces

'==============================================================
' DIRECTED ASSOCIATION - Service -> Service / DAO
'==============================================================
AiSupportService ..> AiSupportSessionRepository : manages
AiSupportService ..> AiSupportMessageRepository : manages
AiSupportService ..> AiSupportUsageRepository : manages
AiSupportService ..> UserRepository : reads
AiSupportService ..> ExerciseRepository : reads
AiSupportService ..> FormRuleRepository : reads
AiSupportService ..> OpenAiChatService : calls provider
AiSupportService ..> GeminiChatService : calls provider
AiSupportService ..> ContentModerationService : checks input
AiSupportService ..> ExercisePhysiologyService : loads profile
AiSupportService ..> PhysiologyAlertService : evaluates alerts
AiSupportService ..> ExerciseSafetyService : checks red flags
FormCorrectionService ..> FormRuleRepository : reads
FormCorrectionService ..> ExerciseRepository : reads
MemberFormRuleService ..> FormRuleRepository : reads
ProgressionRuleService ..> ProgressionRuleRepository : manages
ProgressionRuleService ..> ExerciseRepository : reads
ProgressionRuleService ..> MemberSkillProgressRepository : manages
ProgressionRuleService ..> MemberProfileRepository : reads
ProgressionRuleService ..> UserRepository : reads
ProgressionRuleService ..> SessionExerciseResultRepository : reads
ProgressionRuleService ..> SessionSetResultRepository : reads
ExercisePhysiologyService ..> Exercise : writes exercise_physiology_profiles
PhysiologyAlertService ..> Exercise : reads exercise_physiology_profiles
ContentModerationService ..> ProfanityWordRepository : reads
MemberFavoriteService ..> MemberFavoriteRepository : manages
MemberFavoriteService ..> UserRepository : reads
MemberFavoriteService ..> ExerciseRepository : reads
MemberFavoriteService ..> WorkoutRepository : reads
MemberExerciseService ..> ExerciseRepository : reads
MemberExerciseService ..> MemberFavoriteRepository : reads
MemberExerciseService ..> UserRepository : reads

